> components.
>
> Second, thought I do not think having ind2 is really important, but in each iteration, you can draw an ind2 given beta2,
> other parameters, and the data.  The forward sampling might not be done in Stan currently, but it can be easily carried
> out in, say R, after you complete the sampling.
>
> Regarding the slice sampler, I think for this problem you are still better off not using a discrete sampler as it is
