For those of us who don't use emacs, I've put together a simple syntax highlighter for .stan files for the Sublime Text 2 editor (github.com/dougalsutherland/sublime-stan <https://github.com/dougalsutherland/sublime-stan/blob/master/Stan.tmLanguage>; there's a pull request <https://github.com/wbond/package_control_channel/pull/941> waiting to add this to the package manager thing). These modes are also compatible with Textmate.

