Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

It's rather prone to overflow, but I see what
you're saying.  The

( K * (K - 1) ) / 2

thing should just be choose(K,2).

The whole thing's doubly tricky becuase
you only get this equality:

   (K * (K - 1)) / 2  == K * ((K - 1) / 2)

if K is odd!

- Bob

